WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.765
A Monday request before anything is confirmed Daniel receives a

00:00:04.765 --> 00:00:08.780
message at 07:40 Lindiwe asks him to fit in a

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.945
supplier and move the virtual client discussion to lunch at

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:17.565
the client’s venue The supplier claims approval for 09:45 but

00:00:17.565 --> 00:00:22.970
this is unverified Existing accepted arrangements cover the afternoon site

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:27.190
visit within its current scope They do not establish cover

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.595
for the proposed lunch Before seeing later case developments separate

00:00:32.595 --> 00:00:35.580
what Daniel can do now from what needs another person’s

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:40.150
decision Write what Daniel can do now two unknowns and

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:44.510
who must decide Attempt a response before opening the learning

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:45.960
guidance
